import ../../../testing/driver.dl

window focus test:
    text field "Name" containing "a"
    button "Done"
    code:
        when the "Done" button is clicked:
            increment the value at (this window's state as a pointer to integer)

set count to 0
set instance to an instance of focus test with state (the address of count)
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 500 by 300 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "b" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (the control labeled "Name" in (the address of instance)) in (the address of instance))'s text = "ab") reporting "Typing after queued focus was lost before painting"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (count = 1) reporting "The blurred field consumed the next control's Enter key"
require condition (view's selection's caret source = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text source)) reporting "Leaving the editor retained its active caret"
close the address of view
close the address of instance

document multiline focus test:
    text surface "Program" containing "x" using no UI appearance
    link "Finish" to "/next" using no UI appearance
set instance to an instance of multiline focus test
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 500 by 300 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "y" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (the control labeled "Program" in (the address of instance)) in (the address of instance))'s text = "xy") reporting "Multiline focus required a paint before accepting input"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 256 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's focused's node's text = "Finish") reporting "Escape did not let Tab leave the multiline editor"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "Z" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (the control labeled "Program" in (the address of instance)) in (the address of instance))'s text = "xyZ") reporting "Returning focus did not reactivate editing before paint"
close the address of view
close the address of instance
print line "Editor focus and blur take effect between queued events."
